### ====================================================================
### ZapSign OneClick API - Testes
### ====================================================================
### Use com extensão REST Client do VS Code ou Thunder Client
### Substitua {{token}} pelo seu Bearer token de autenticação
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 1: OneClick com Email Automático (ZapSign envia)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Teste OneClick - Email Auto",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "João da Silva",
      "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
      "send_automatic_email": true,
      "qualification": "parte"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maria Santos",
      "email": "maria.santos@example.com",
      "send_automatic_email": true,
      "qualification": "testemunha"
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 2: OneClick com WhatsApp Automático 
### ATENÇÃO: Custa R$ 0,50 por envio!
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Teste OneClick - WhatsApp Auto",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Almeida",
      "email": "carlos@example.com",
      "phone_country": "+55",
      "phone_number": "11987654321",
      "send_automatic_whatsapp": true,
      "qualification": "advogado"
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 3: OneClick com Ordem de Assinatura Sequencial
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Teste OneClick - Ordem Sequencial",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "signature_order_active": true,
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "Primeiro Signatário",
      "email": "primeiro@example.com",
      "order_group": 1,
      "qualification": "parte"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segundo Signatário",
      "email": "segundo@example.com",
      "order_group": 2,
      "qualification": "testemunha"
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 4: OneClick Manual (sem auto-send) - Sistema envia email customizado
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Teste OneClick - Email Customizado",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "notifyEmail": true,
  "clientName": "Cliente Teste",
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "Destinatário Manual",
      "email": "manual@example.com",
      "send_automatic_email": false,
      "qualification": "parte"
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 5: OneClick com BASE64 (upload direto)
### NOTA: Substitua BASE64_CONTENT pelo PDF convertido em base64
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Teste OneClick - Upload Base64",
  "base64_pdf": "BASE64_CONTENT_AQUI",
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "Teste Upload",
      "email": "upload@example.com",
      "send_automatic_email": true
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 6: API Padrão (backward compatibility - useOneClick: false)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": false,
  "name": "Teste API Padrão",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "Teste Padrão",
      "email": "padrao@example.com",
      "auth_mode": "assinaturaTela",
      "require_cpf": true
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 7: Obter Documento (verificar resposta OneClick)
### Substitua {TOKEN_DO_DOCUMENTO} pelo token retornado na criação
### ====================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents/{TOKEN_DO_DOCUMENTO}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ====================================================================
### TESTE 8: OneClick COMPLETO - Todas as opções
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zapsign/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "useOneClick": true,
  "name": "Contrato Teste - Todas Opções",
  "url_pdf": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "require_signature": true,
  "lang": "pt-br",
  "brand_name": "FACILITA ADV",
  "external_id": "processo-123-teste",
  "folder_path": "/facilita-adv/testes/",
  "date_limit_to_sign": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "signature_order_active": true,
  "observers": ["observador@example.com"],
  "reminder_every_n_days": 3,
  "allow_refuse_signature": true,
  "signers": [
    {
      "name": "João da Silva",
      "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
      "phone_country": "+55",
      "phone_number": "11987654321",
      "send_automatic_email": true,
      "qualification": "parte",
      "order_group": 1,
      "custom_message": "Olá João,\nPor favor, assine este contrato.\nAbraços,\nEquipe FACILITA ADV"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maria Santos",
      "email": "maria.santos@example.com",
      "send_automatic_email": true,
      "qualification": "testemunha",
      "order_group": 2,
      "redirect_link": "https://facilita.adv.br/obrigado"
    }
  ]
}

### ====================================================================
### VERIFICAÇÃO ESPERADA:
### ====================================================================
### ✅ Status 200 OK
### ✅ Response contém: token, open_id, status, signers[].sign_url
### ✅ sign_url formato: https://app.zapsign.com.br/verificar/oneclick/{token}
### ✅ Se send_automatic_email: true, ZapSign envia email (não nosso sistema)
### ✅ Se send_automatic_email: false, nosso sistema envia email customizado
### ✅ Console log: "[ZapSign] Skipping custom emails - ZapSign will send..."
###     (quando send_automatic_email: true)
### ====================================================================

### ====================================================================
### COMO USAR:
### ====================================================================
### 1. Instale extensão "REST Client" no VS Code
### 2. Obtenha token de autenticação:
###    - Login no sistema
###    - Inspecionar network
###    - Copiar Bearer token do header Authorization
### 3. Substitua {{token}} acima
### 4. Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada teste
### 5. Verifique respostas no painel direito
### ====================================================================
